+++ b/docs/FRONTEND_ARCHITECTURE.md
@@ -4,6 +4,13 @@
 
 Frontend - React SPA on Vite, TypeScript and Tailwind. The UI is an operational knowledge base, so it should prioritize fast navigation, readable documents, dense lists and predictable controls.
 
+Shared UI ownership belongs to [Base UI/UX Standard](../../services-base/docs/platform/UI_UX_STANDARD.md).
+Wiki imports shell, controls, states and page compositions from `@sdlc/ui`;
+it supplies domain slots, data and callbacks without a second UI kit or token set.
+The earlier local Radix/shadcn choice is superseded. Snapshot wiring is documented
+in [Base Integration](BASE_INTEGRATION.md); routes and exceptions belong to the
+[UI/UX Map](UI_UX_MAP.md).
+
