 ## 3. Target Folders
 
+This is a target domain-folder map, not an inventory of shipped files.
+`widgets/app-shell.tsx` is the product adapter for Base `AppShell`, not a separate
+shell implementation. `shared/ui` contains domain adapters; common primitives
+and tokens remain in Base.
+
