 ## 4. Rationale
 
+Shared shell, controls, states, page compositions and semantic tokens belong to
+[Base UI/UX Standard](../../services-base/docs/platform/UI_UX_STANDARD.md).
+The earlier local Radix/shadcn choice is superseded for product UI ownership;
+Wiki imports Base primitives and owns only domain adapters, content and actions.
+See [Base Integration](BASE_INTEGRATION.md) and the [UI/UX Map](UI_UX_MAP.md).
+
 The stack stays close to the broader SDLC toolset to reuse operational knowledge, while adding Wiki-specific libraries only where the base product needs them: Markdown, sanitization, local attachment storage, search and revision diffing.
